  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  FisherPDF
  @  Density (or mass) at X.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "FisherPDF: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → dfnv dfdv Xv « dfnv 0 + dfdv 0 + Xv 0 + → dfn dfd X « 'IFTE(X≤0;0;(Γ((dfn+dfd)/2)/(Γ(dfn/2)*Γ(dfd/2)))*((dfn/dfd)^(dfn/2))*(X^(dfn/2-1))*((1+dfn*X/dfd)^(-(dfn+dfd)/2)))' →Num dfnv dfdv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
»
